{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach, take, then process it. If not safe, move location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaSafe    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
